{"id":"normal","lemma":"normal","pos":"adj","rank":576,"glosses":["normal (customary, standard, not deviating from a norm)","normal (typical, usual)","(that's) expected, (that's) obvious"],"ipa":"/noɾˈmal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"normales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-normal.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo me siento normal.","en":"I feel normal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440278"},{"text":"Respira de forma normal.","en":"Breathe normally.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443198"},{"text":"Soy un tipo normal.","en":"I'm a normal guy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442726"},{"text":"Esto no es normal.","en":"This ain't normal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450536"},{"text":"Eso es muy normal.","en":"That's very normal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/541104"}]}